  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the point of intersection of the lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is any non-zero real parameter) is",
